WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.920
<b>ATTENTION</b>

00:01.000 --> 00:03.920
<b>HAZARDOUS WAVES TODAY</b>

00:01.000 --> 00:03.920
<b>NO SWIMMING ALLOWED</b>

00:01.750 --> 00:03.750
"No swimming allowed"?

00:14.330 --> 00:16.170
Those are some rough waves.

00:16.170 --> 00:18.830
I guess we're not taking a dip
in the ocean today.

00:18.830 --> 00:20.170
And what's worse...

00:20.170 --> 00:22.710
all the seaside shops and cafes are closed.

00:23.170 --> 00:24.960
Aw man! This blows!

00:24.960 --> 00:26.580
I'm gonna let off some steam!

00:27.880 --> 00:29.080
Screw you...

00:29.080 --> 00:31.420
DUMBASS OCEAAAAAN!

00:31.040 --> 00:31.790
<b>Ocean Lover</b>

00:31.790 --> 00:32.500
<b>Ocean Lover</b>

00:34.960 --> 00:36.580
What's up with those two?

00:44.920 --> 00:48.040
Hah! Slowpoke! Slowpoke!

00:47.040 --> 00:50.670
<b>The Ocean Lover's Cafe</b>

00:48.790 --> 00:50.670
Now! Let's move, Ryunosuke!

00:53.710 --> 00:57.580
SCREW YOU, DUMBASS OCEAAAAAAN!

00:55.540 --> 00:57.580
<b>SCREW YOU, DUMBASS OCEAN!</b>

00:58.420 --> 01:00.580
<b>UHHHH...</b>

01:06.790 --> 01:08.420
You chowderhead!

01:08.420 --> 01:09.960
When are ya gonna...

01:10.130 --> 01:12.290
<b>BIFF!</b>

01:10.380 --> 01:12.880
GET IT THROUGH YER HEAAAAAD?!

01:14.670 --> 01:17.790
I've told ya over and over
not to screw up the timing like that.

01:17.790 --> 01:19.580
Get it together, dammit!

01:20.580 --> 01:22.000
Hey, Bozo!

01:22.000 --> 01:24.380
Didja forget who shouted
the signal for us to go?!

01:24.540 --> 01:27.040
<b>Straight Left Punch</b>

01:24.540 --> 01:27.040
<b>POW!</b>

01:25.040 --> 01:27.460
BECAUSE IT WAS YOU, JACKASS!

01:31.210 --> 01:33.420
That was a damn good punch...

01:34.420 --> 01:36.380
But let me ask ya one thing, Ryunosuke.

01:36.630 --> 01:37.710
Why me?

01:37.920 --> 01:41.460
Why don't ya take that anger
and direct it at the ocean?

01:41.710 --> 01:44.630
<b>BABUUUUUUM</b>

01:42.170 --> 01:44.630
WHAT SENSE DOES IT MAKE
TO PUNCH YER OWN DAD?!

01:44.790 --> 01:47.750
DON'T GIVE ME THAT BULLCRAP,
YOU'RE THE ONE WHO PUNCHED ME FIRST!

01:49.960 --> 01:52.790
Uh, hello. May I ask what you folks
are doing out here?

01:52.960 --> 01:54.920
Please don't fight each other.

01:55.210 --> 01:57.040
We can do whatever we damn well please!

01:57.040 --> 01:57.290
<b>BIFF!</b>

01:57.790 --> 01:59.250
Why hello!

01:59.250 --> 02:00.630
Thank you...

02:00.630 --> 02:04.250
I'M SO GLAD YOU ASKEEEEEEED!

02:05.170 --> 02:06.920
I get the feeling this is gonna take a while...

02:06.920 --> 02:08.750
He's got way too much energy.

03:39.040 --> 03:41.460
<b>The Ocean Lover's Cafe</b>

03:41.460 --> 03:43.630
<b>Family Feud!!</b>

03:42.000 --> 03:43.630
So, you guys run a seaside cafe.

03:43.790 --> 03:46.040
Yeah. This cafe has a long history,

03:46.040 --> 03:48.420
having been passed down through
three generations of our family.

03:48.420 --> 03:49.500
Wow!

03:49.710 --> 03:52.130
And this here is Ryunosuke,
the fourth generation.

03:52.130 --> 03:54.080
I never said I was
taking over the family biz!

03:54.080 --> 03:56.380
Not that crap again!
Quit being such a goddamn numbskull!

03:56.380 --> 03:58.080
Who are you calling a numbskull!

03:59.290 --> 04:00.420
<b>CRRRASSSHHHHH!</b>

04:01.960 --> 04:04.000
He's a hell-raiser, ya see.

04:04.000 --> 04:05.580
Hard for me to manage.

04:05.580 --> 04:07.630
Jee, wonder where I got that from!

04:07.830 --> 04:10.750
So, we saw you two yelling
"dumbass" at the ocean earlier.

04:10.750 --> 04:11.960
What was that all about?

04:11.960 --> 04:16.670
Well, little lady, seaside cafes like ours
have their fate tied to the ocean.

04:16.670 --> 04:17.830
In other words...

04:17.830 --> 04:20.130
our cafe exists because of the ocean.

04:20.130 --> 04:22.630
And the ocean prospers because of our cafe.

04:22.630 --> 04:24.130
HOWEVER!

04:24.130 --> 04:27.790
At the end of each summer, the ocean
starts dishing out huge waves like this

04:27.790 --> 04:30.080
that prevent us from getting any business!

04:30.710 --> 04:34.210
The ocean is... A NO-GOOD TRAITOR!

04:32.710 --> 04:34.210
<b>KERSPLASH!</b>

04:34.380 --> 04:37.080
SCREW YOU, DUMBASS OCEAN!

04:37.420 --> 04:39.170
I'm fed up with all this crap.

04:39.330 --> 04:41.170
I'm definitely gonna find
a different career.

04:41.170 --> 04:42.130
Dammit!

04:42.130 --> 04:43.920
Quit being such a knucklehead!

04:43.920 --> 04:45.130
Hold on, mister!

04:45.130 --> 04:46.880
Violence isn't the answer!
C'mon, Ryunosuke!<b>
</b>Why can't you just understand?!<b></b>

04:46.880 --> 04:47.750
C'mon, Ryunosuke!
Why can't you just understand?!

04:47.750 --> 04:48.750
And you over there!

04:48.750 --> 04:51.040
Have some compassion
and hear your dad out!

04:51.040 --> 04:54.170
It's not that simple!
I'm seriously at my limit!

04:55.170 --> 04:56.790
Ryunosuke...

04:57.670 --> 05:02.080
You gotta understand, we keep this
seaside cafe running all year round.

05:02.080 --> 05:03.210
Huh?

05:03.210 --> 05:04.540
All year round...?

05:04.540 --> 05:06.580
It's miserable being here in winter.

05:06.580 --> 05:07.790
Seriously!

05:09.500 --> 05:12.750
Out in the cold when a blizzard rolls through...

05:12.750 --> 05:14.540
no way in hell customers would come!

05:14.540 --> 05:16.830
Daddy! I'm freezing!

05:16.830 --> 05:19.380
Don't be a wuss!
You got my blood running in ya!

05:16.830 --> 05:19.380
<b>Come in for a</b>

05:16.830 --> 05:19.380
<b>hot bowl of udon!</b>

05:19.380 --> 05:21.460
But nobody's gonna come!

05:22.830 --> 05:25.630
My old man would always give me
a tongue-lashing...

05:26.880 --> 05:27.880
Let's bail.

05:27.880 --> 05:28.750
Sounds good.

05:28.750 --> 05:31.290
Darling! Are you sure you want to leave?

05:31.290 --> 05:32.250
What's the problem?

05:32.250 --> 05:35.080
Come on, we should help these two somehow.

05:35.380 --> 05:37.460
It's not our problem to worry about.

05:37.460 --> 05:40.960
Deciding the future of their business
is entirely a family matter.

05:40.960 --> 05:45.500
Exactly. Outsiders shouldn't have
any say in it, you know?

05:45.500 --> 05:47.580
You heard what those people said.

05:47.580 --> 05:49.790
Quit yer whinin' and just take over the cafe.

05:49.790 --> 05:51.330
Why the hell should I?

05:51.330 --> 05:53.710
Hmm. This doesn't sit right with me.
Because kids should listen to their parents, dammit!<b></b>

05:53.710 --> 05:56.460
It would be rude for us to butt in on their family issues.
Fine then, I'll just forsake you and go live on my own!<b></b>

05:56.460 --> 05:57.670
What he said.
Fine then, I'll just forsake you and go live on my own!<b></b>

05:57.880 --> 06:01.080
You were supposed to grow into a man
with enough guts to take on the ocean itself!

06:01.080 --> 06:02.750
<b>FIRST BORN OF THE FUJINAMI FAMILY</b>

06:01.080 --> 06:02.750
<b>RYUNOSUKE</b>

06:01.080 --> 06:02.750
<b>(Helpful and assertive, like a dragon)</b>

06:01.090 --> 06:02.750
That's why I chose the name "Ryunosuke"!

06:02.880 --> 06:05.830
At least try to live up to my expectations!

06:05.830 --> 06:07.790
But that's what pisses me off the most!

06:07.790 --> 06:10.420
Why the hell do I have to live like a man?!

06:11.830 --> 06:13.290
You know I'm...

06:13.290 --> 06:14.790
A WOMAN!

06:16.630 --> 06:17.920
Hey, wait!

06:18.170 --> 06:20.080
Whoa! I thought you guys left!

06:20.080 --> 06:21.790
H-hold the phone!

06:22.040 --> 06:23.540
Let us take a good look at you!

06:23.540 --> 06:25.000
What's the deal?

06:25.000 --> 06:26.460
You're creepin' me out.

06:31.080 --> 06:32.420
I thought we were going home.

06:32.420 --> 06:35.630
Are you nuts?! We can't just abandon
this family in their time of need!

06:36.750 --> 06:39.500
I'm so sorry that you have to
go through this, baby.

06:39.500 --> 06:42.500
If there's anything that I can help with,
just say the word.

06:44.040 --> 06:44.960
<b>BIFF!</b>

06:44.040 --> 06:44.960
<b>POW!</b>

06:45.130 --> 06:47.330
Keep your gross hands off me, you creeps!

06:47.330 --> 06:50.080
You're so rough and rowdy
because of how you were raised, huh?

06:50.380 --> 06:53.460
This sucks! It's all my stupid dad's fault!

06:56.080 --> 06:57.920
You girls are lucky.

06:58.330 --> 07:01.210
Getting to walk around in
glitzy outfits like that.

07:01.210 --> 07:02.420
You mean our swimsuits?

07:02.420 --> 07:06.330
Meanwhile, I've never gotten to wear
so much as a friggin' skirt.

07:06.330 --> 07:09.460
Stuff like sailor uniforms are what
my dreams are made of!

07:10.250 --> 07:11.670
Hey, Ryunosuke?

07:11.670 --> 07:12.960
Whatchu want?

07:13.420 --> 07:15.790
HAVE THE OCEAN
KNOCK SOME SENSE INTO YOU!

07:16.000 --> 07:17.750
<b>KA-FOOOOOM!</b>

07:19.330 --> 07:20.250
Oh crap!

07:20.250 --> 07:21.420
I got you, babe!

07:21.540 --> 07:22.790
<b>SMASH!</b>

07:24.790 --> 07:25.380
<b>THUD</b>

07:27.420 --> 07:29.170
Don't take it personally.

07:29.170 --> 07:31.630
Pickin' fights just runs in my blood.

07:31.960 --> 07:32.540
<b>SQUEEZE</b>

07:32.170 --> 07:33.790
You poor little thing.

07:34.080 --> 07:34.670
<b>BLAMO!</b>

07:34.880 --> 07:36.750
Keep your hands to yourself!

07:38.290 --> 07:39.790
Ryunosuke...

07:39.790 --> 07:42.420
Look close. The sea is raging!

07:42.830 --> 07:45.380
It has such power. Such brawn.

07:45.380 --> 07:47.420
And a ferocity that's inspiring.

07:47.710 --> 07:51.500
So you gotta be a man if ya wanna
survive in our line of biz!

07:47.710 --> 07:51.500
<b>MANLY</b>

07:52.210 --> 07:54.960
<b>Right Uppercut</b>

07:52.210 --> 07:54.960
<b>POW!</b>

07:52.790 --> 07:54.960
I'M A WOMAN, DAMMIT!

07:57.750 --> 08:01.710
All right... that one really hurt...

08:02.250 --> 08:05.290
But like I said, what sense is there
in punching yer dad?

08:05.290 --> 08:08.000
Whatever, I already know that
punching you gets me nowhere!

08:08.880 --> 08:10.080
Okay, let's bail for real.

08:10.080 --> 08:11.710
Wait, where are ya going?!

08:11.960 --> 08:15.210
You wouldn't just leave a poor father
to fend for himself, would ya?!

08:15.210 --> 08:16.630
My apologies, but...

08:16.630 --> 08:20.130
There's nothing that we can do.
You two just have too much baggage, dude.

08:22.790 --> 08:24.920
Oh yeah? We get free food?

08:24.920 --> 08:26.880
Shucks, how kind of you!

08:26.880 --> 08:30.170
Please eat up and then help convince
Ryunosuke to come over to my side.

08:30.170 --> 08:32.670
Hah! This is most pathetic thing
you've ever done, Dad!

08:32.670 --> 08:34.630
Relying on strangers
to do your work like some loser!

08:35.380 --> 08:37.040
What did you just say?!

08:35.580 --> 08:38.830
<b>Left Straight Punch</b>

08:37.040 --> 08:39.420
I'm only putting myself
through this shit for yer sake!

08:39.580 --> 08:41.130
YOU CHOWDERHEAD!

08:41.420 --> 08:42.380
<b>KAPOW!</b>

08:47.290 --> 08:48.540
Blow for blow!

08:48.540 --> 08:50.460
Th-that was a cross-counter!

08:51.290 --> 08:52.380
So...

08:52.380 --> 08:54.960
do you really think that we can
persuade these two?

08:54.960 --> 08:56.540
I highly doubt it.

08:57.040 --> 08:59.750
For now, we just have to prevent them
from fighting each other.

08:59.960 --> 09:03.330
All right, so take this and then
put that hand over there...

09:11.330 --> 09:13.920
A-are you friggin' kidding me?!

09:11.330 --> 09:17.420
<b>CLICK</b>

09:13.920 --> 09:16.380
Hey, old man! What's the big idea?!

09:16.380 --> 09:17.670
You numbskull!

09:17.670 --> 09:20.460
Don't ya see I'm stuck in
the same damn situation?!

09:17.670 --> 09:20.460
<b>CLICK</b>

09:20.630 --> 09:22.250
Now you can't fight anymore!

09:22.250 --> 09:24.420
Leave brute force out of it and
use your words instead!

09:24.420 --> 09:26.540
Goddammit! You friggin' twerps!

09:26.540 --> 09:30.250
Are you trying to keep me trapped in this
stupid cafe for the rest of my life or what?!

09:30.250 --> 09:31.670
Ryunosuke!

09:31.670 --> 09:34.830
These kind people are just trying to
help you make the right choice!

09:34.830 --> 09:37.920
WHATEVER! EAT MY FIST, OLD MAN!

09:37.920 --> 09:40.580
BRING IT ON! THEM'S FIGHTING WORDS!

09:41.880 --> 09:42.380
<b>SNAP!</b>

09:42.630 --> 09:43.170
<b>SNAP!</b>

09:55.750 --> 09:57.830
Screw you! Shit head!

09:57.830 --> 09:59.210
Cocky little punk!

09:59.540 --> 10:00.920
What a waste.
Look out, because my rage<b>
</b>is like the stormy sea!<b></b>

10:00.920 --> 10:02.420
I've had all that I can stand.
Look out, because my rage<b>
</b>is like the stormy sea!<b></b>

10:02.420 --> 10:02.960
Look out, because my rage
is like the stormy sea!

10:02.960 --> 10:06.670
I'll put you through the grinder
until you're ready to live in a man's world!

10:06.670 --> 10:10.670
Like I said... I'M A WOMAAAAAAAN!

10:15.540 --> 10:17.630
<b>Ocean Lover</b>

10:17.830 --> 10:19.790
Where are we going, old man?

10:19.790 --> 10:21.500
Shaddup and just let me lead.

10:22.080 --> 10:25.080
Ryunosuke! You better be
pushing the cart back there!

10:25.080 --> 10:26.500
You bet I am.

10:26.500 --> 10:28.830
Then why does it feel so heavy?!

10:28.830 --> 10:30.460
Cuz you're getting decrepit.

10:32.880 --> 10:33.500
<b>DROP</b>

10:51.330 --> 10:53.210
Darling! It's those two again!

10:53.210 --> 10:55.580
Oh, that family we saw at
the seaside cafe last week.

10:56.130 --> 10:58.000
What are you two doing here?

10:58.000 --> 10:59.670
Hm? Oh hello, kids.

10:59.670 --> 11:02.630
Well, since our cafe got totally destroyed, we-

11:02.630 --> 11:04.210
have to find a way somehow-

11:04.210 --> 11:06.670
to earn money-
so we can, ow, rebuild.

11:06.670 --> 11:09.290
We found- ow, a live-in job at
the school supply store,

11:09.290 --> 11:12.710
and we're on our way
to start working there...

11:16.130 --> 11:19.130
JEEEEZ, KNOCK IT OFF ALREADY!

11:19.630 --> 11:21.250
Feast your eyes, Ryunosuke.

11:21.250 --> 11:24.210
This is the new stormy sea
that we must conquer.

11:24.210 --> 11:27.000
Yer a student at this school starting today.

11:35.000 --> 11:37.790
Wanna try wearing this, Ryunosuke?

11:37.790 --> 11:39.500
Is... that what I think it is?

11:39.830 --> 11:42.460
A s-sailor uniform?!

11:42.460 --> 11:44.580
Well, yer only gonna wear it
over my dead body.

11:44.580 --> 11:46.960
So ya gotta beat me in battle first!

11:46.960 --> 11:48.670
Are you serious about that, Dad?

11:48.670 --> 11:50.540
A man never goes back on his word!

11:50.540 --> 11:52.290
What's going on? Some kinda fight?

11:52.290 --> 11:54.330
Ryu, baby! You got this!

11:54.330 --> 11:56.750
What nonsense are you kids up to now?!

11:56.750 --> 11:59.500
Hey! You're that new transfer student!
Get to the classroom on the doub-

11:59.500 --> 12:00.080
<b>KAPOW!</b>

12:00.210 --> 12:01.580
Get outta the way!

12:01.580 --> 12:05.460
This is it! My life is on the verge
of serious change!

12:06.330 --> 12:08.670
I've watched so many young ladies
chattering happily

12:08.670 --> 12:10.670
as their skirts flutter in the wind...

12:10.670 --> 12:14.290
It's a sight that filled me with
nothing but envy!

12:14.790 --> 12:16.920
And now, I'm one step away from...

12:16.920 --> 12:19.380
HAVING MY OWN SAILOR UNIFORM!

12:20.630 --> 12:22.630
It won't be that easy!

12:22.630 --> 12:24.750
Because yer dad never goes down
without a fight!

12:26.460 --> 12:27.920
<b>WHOOOF!</b>

12:28.080 --> 12:30.290
Okay, old man! You're going down!

12:30.920 --> 12:32.290
Here I come!

12:33.330 --> 12:35.000
Such a hottie!

12:35.580 --> 12:36.960
<b>BOYOING!</b>

12:36.380 --> 12:39.170
Yer wide open!

12:37.250 --> 12:38.250
<b>SMASSHHHH!</b>

12:39.420 --> 12:40.710
You numbskull.

12:40.710 --> 12:43.170
Yer too young to stand
any chance against me!

12:44.170 --> 12:46.250
What an awful turn of events.

12:46.790 --> 12:48.290
You poor thing.

12:49.000 --> 12:49.420
<b>KAPOW!</b>

12:49.540 --> 12:51.710
IT'S YOUR FAULT I LOST, DAMMIT!

12:51.710 --> 12:54.380
<b>Hello, Sailor Suit!!</b>

12:52.670 --> 12:54.380
So, without further ado...

12:54.630 --> 12:57.040
I'd like to introduce
our new transfer student.

12:57.420 --> 12:59.250
The name's Ryunosuke Fujinami.

12:59.250 --> 13:00.710
Nice to meetcha.

13:00.710 --> 13:02.330
So stoic!

13:02.330 --> 13:03.670
Ryunosuke, what a looker!

13:03.670 --> 13:05.460
I'm a woman, to be clear.

13:05.460 --> 13:06.580
How cute!

13:06.580 --> 13:08.080
Totally my type, either way!

13:08.080 --> 13:10.790
Adorable! Simple adorable!

13:10.790 --> 13:13.330
Seems like Mendo's reign is over now.

13:14.170 --> 13:16.290
This is very concerning...

13:18.630 --> 13:22.670
It appears that Ms. Ryunosuke has caught
the attention of all the girls in class.

13:22.670 --> 13:24.960
She's got a monopoly on them for sure.

13:24.960 --> 13:28.130
And before you know it, they'll have
forgotten that we even exist.

13:28.130 --> 13:30.500
We have to do something.

13:30.500 --> 13:33.500
Wish we could see Ryu in
a sailor uniform instead.

13:33.500 --> 13:34.960
That's it!

13:36.170 --> 13:37.630
Yo, pops!

13:38.290 --> 13:39.880
One sailor uniform, please!

13:39.880 --> 13:42.710
Yeah, right. I know you boys
are in Ryunosuke's pocket.

13:39.880 --> 13:46.290
<b>School Supplies</b>

13:42.710 --> 13:44.080
That makes things simple.

13:44.080 --> 13:46.290
Just sell us the sailor uniform
nice and easy.

13:46.420 --> 13:48.170
No way in hell!

13:48.170 --> 13:50.670
If you really want that sailor uniform...

13:50.670 --> 13:52.750
YER GONNA HAVE TO GET THROUGH ME FIRST!

13:50.670 --> 13:52.750
<b>BOOOOM!</b>

13:52.880 --> 13:53.920
Have it your way!

13:53.500 --> 13:55.750
<b>BIFF!</b>

13:53.500 --> 13:55.750
<b>POW!</b>

13:53.500 --> 13:55.750
<b>BAM!</b>

13:57.460 --> 13:59.630
You cheating bastards...

14:01.080 --> 14:03.500
That's just how we do business here, pops!

14:03.790 --> 14:05.710
<b>CLASS 2-4</b>

14:04.580 --> 14:05.710
Oh, wow.

14:05.960 --> 14:09.210
So you were raised as a boy
to take over the family business?

14:09.210 --> 14:12.210
I don't really get how that works,
but you're awesome, Ryunosuke!

14:12.210 --> 14:13.710
Yeah, totally!

14:13.710 --> 14:15.920
Stuff like that makes you seem mysterious!

14:15.920 --> 14:17.420
Sailor uniforms...

14:18.040 --> 14:19.790
Wish I could wear one.

14:19.790 --> 14:21.000
Ryu, my sweet!

14:21.420 --> 14:22.330
Here!

14:22.330 --> 14:23.250
This is for you.

14:24.500 --> 14:26.670
H-hold the phone! Is this legit?!

14:26.670 --> 14:30.000
We put our best foot forward
and convinced your father to allow it.

14:30.000 --> 14:30.830
What?!

14:30.830 --> 14:32.710
Is it really okay for me to wear it?!

14:32.710 --> 14:34.330
Of course, go for it!

14:43.920 --> 14:47.250
Nah... just the sentiment
is enough for me, thanks.

14:48.330 --> 14:53.000
The thing is, I'm never gonna be happy
unless I beat my dad and claim it for myself.

14:53.000 --> 14:56.080
And then, I'll be able to wear
this uniform with pride!

14:56.420 --> 14:57.250
Wow!

14:57.250 --> 14:58.580
So cool!

14:58.580 --> 15:02.210
I really don't think it's worth
making such a big deal over.

15:04.460 --> 15:06.290
And besides...

15:06.290 --> 15:11.290
it feels like there's still something lacking
that I have to find before I can wear it.

15:14.040 --> 15:15.830
Lummy-poo, are you here?

15:17.040 --> 15:18.960
Ah, there you are!

15:22.500 --> 15:24.500
H-holy crap...

15:25.000 --> 15:27.130
She's the spitting image of
the ladies in sailor uniforms

15:27.130 --> 15:29.040
who I looked up to back in the day!

15:29.040 --> 15:30.500
Here, I'm returning this.

15:30.500 --> 15:32.710
But then I need to borrow
another textbook, kay?

15:32.710 --> 15:33.960
Sure thing.

15:33.960 --> 15:35.790
Yay! Thank you!

15:35.790 --> 15:37.580
I'll swing by later!

15:38.250 --> 15:40.540
Hey Ran. You're looking mighty fine today.

15:40.540 --> 15:43.170
Oh, please! You're so silly, darling!

15:44.960 --> 15:46.790
Anyway, tata for now!

15:46.790 --> 15:48.330
See ya!

15:48.710 --> 15:50.710
Hey! Who was that girl?!

15:50.710 --> 15:52.880
Her name's Ran, she's my childhood friend.

15:52.880 --> 15:56.290
D-do me a favor! Please tell me
how I can get in touch with her!

15:56.290 --> 15:57.380
WHAT?!

15:57.380 --> 15:58.040
<b>AND THEN...</b>

16:00.670 --> 16:02.040
What's this?

16:02.040 --> 16:04.380
"Ryunosuke Fujinami"?

16:05.040 --> 16:07.460
<b>I really would like to be your friend.</b>

16:05.040 --> 16:07.460
<b>Please hang out with me.</b>

16:05.040 --> 16:07.460
<b>Can't wait to hear from you!!</b>

16:05.040 --> 16:07.460
<b>For Ran</b>

16:05.040 --> 16:07.460
<b>From Ryunosuke Fujinami</b>

16:05.050 --> 16:07.460
Aw jeez, another love letter?

16:05.050 --> 16:07.460
<b>Class 2-4</b>

16:07.750 --> 16:09.830
Huh, must be a new kid...

16:09.830 --> 16:12.710
Hold up. He's in class 2-4?

16:13.210 --> 16:15.130
<b>CLASS 2-4</b>

16:15.290 --> 16:17.460
Oh, Lummy-poo! Thanks for this.

16:17.460 --> 16:20.000
Hey, can you show me where Fujinami sits?

16:20.460 --> 16:22.460
Ryunosuke is right over there.

16:22.460 --> 16:24.420
Oh, I see!

16:24.420 --> 16:26.630
Gosh, what should I do?

16:26.630 --> 16:30.000
Maybe I'll go on a date with him
to liven things up a little!

16:30.000 --> 16:32.080
Hm? What are you talking about?

16:32.630 --> 16:36.630
Well, you see, I actually got
a love letter from him earlier!

16:35.250 --> 16:36.080
<b>SQUEE</b>

16:36.630 --> 16:39.000
Ryunosuke is a girl, though.

16:40.670 --> 16:41.830
What?!

16:41.830 --> 16:43.420
Are you trying to make fun of me
or something?!

16:43.420 --> 16:44.790
I'm being serious!

16:44.790 --> 16:47.380
Hmph. I see how it is, Lum.

16:47.380 --> 16:48.250
Huh?

16:48.250 --> 16:51.710
How pathetic!
You're just jealous of my popularity!

16:51.710 --> 16:53.380
You've got the wrong idea!

16:53.380 --> 16:57.670
Oh, this'll be fun.
Because I love doing anything that...

16:57.670 --> 16:59.500
gets on your nerves!

17:01.750 --> 17:03.170
Hiya, Ryunosuke!

17:03.170 --> 17:04.580
Uh, hey!

17:04.830 --> 17:08.290
Guess what?
I'm totally willing to go out with you!

17:08.290 --> 17:09.750
WHAT?!

17:09.750 --> 17:12.330
Really?! You're serious about
spending some time with me?!

17:15.170 --> 17:17.630
After school today,
wait for me by the entrance, kay?

17:18.420 --> 17:19.710
Sure!

17:20.040 --> 17:22.500
N-no way, my precious Ryu
and my sweet Ran...

17:22.830 --> 17:25.080
I can't let this happen!

17:28.170 --> 17:31.790
I'm gonna be like Ran and learn how to
make a sailor uniform look good!

17:31.790 --> 17:35.920
I'll stick around her until I know everything
that I need to be more feminine!

17:35.920 --> 17:37.830
Ryunosuke!

17:37.830 --> 17:38.670
Ran!

17:47.710 --> 17:49.710
S-such a slow run...

17:50.130 --> 17:51.960
I dunno how I should fill the time.

17:52.290 --> 17:54.920
Man, girls are just incredible!

17:54.920 --> 17:56.670
I'm so sorry!

17:56.670 --> 17:58.580
Gosh, did you wait long?

17:58.580 --> 18:01.130
Nah. Just a little bit.

18:01.420 --> 18:03.170
So, uh, hey.

18:03.170 --> 18:04.460
What is it?

18:04.460 --> 18:08.330
This is kinda my first time
going out with a girl like this.

18:08.330 --> 18:10.080
Squee! Oh, really?

18:10.580 --> 18:13.040
And like, I was hoping...

18:13.710 --> 18:16.170
you could teach me
all the secrets about women!

18:18.710 --> 18:19.080
<b>OH MY!</b>

18:19.460 --> 18:21.420
How daring!

18:21.420 --> 18:24.500
I wasn't expecting this guy
to be such a perv...

18:27.330 --> 18:30.540
H-holy crap!
Are we having p-p-p-parfaits?!

18:30.540 --> 18:31.920
What's the matter?

18:31.920 --> 18:34.290
Well, I've never been to a place like this.

18:34.290 --> 18:36.000
Much less eaten a parfait!

18:36.460 --> 18:37.500
Oh?

18:38.130 --> 18:39.670
Aw hell.

18:39.670 --> 18:43.080
I didn't mean to lose my cool
over this fancy parfait!

18:43.080 --> 18:46.130
I gotta stay focused on learning
how to be lady-like from Ran!

18:47.710 --> 18:48.250
<b>MUNCH</b>

18:49.170 --> 18:50.790
So yummy!

18:52.250 --> 18:54.460
Keep both elbows tucked near the torso.

18:54.460 --> 18:55.830
Tilt the chin down.

18:55.830 --> 18:58.460
Rotate your wrist as you take a bite and smile.

18:59.920 --> 19:01.830
<b>FIDGET</b>

19:00.380 --> 19:02.500
That's the way! That's the way! That's the way!

19:02.500 --> 19:03.790
Nailed it!

19:04.080 --> 19:05.330
Guess who?

19:05.330 --> 19:06.670
I'm busy here!

19:06.670 --> 19:07.330
<b>KAPOW!</b>

19:07.460 --> 19:09.630
Leave me the hell alone!

19:07.460 --> 19:09.250
<b>BAM!</b>

19:11.710 --> 19:13.250
Lummy-poo!

19:13.250 --> 19:15.420
What a coincidence, huh?

19:15.420 --> 19:18.420
Shucks! I'm so happy to see you!

19:19.170 --> 19:20.540
C'mere.

19:22.670 --> 19:24.250
What's the big friggin' idea?!

19:24.250 --> 19:26.540
Sneaking around
and spying on me like that!

19:26.540 --> 19:27.960
I don't know what to say.

19:27.960 --> 19:30.710
The only reason I'm here is because
I followed my darling, okay?

19:30.710 --> 19:32.670
I see how it is, Lum.

19:32.670 --> 19:35.670
Ran's interpretation of events
is always off...

19:35.670 --> 19:38.420
Dammit! I can't believe you
fell in love with Ryunosuke!

19:38.420 --> 19:39.670
You two-timing cheat!

19:40.080 --> 19:42.250
I figured that's what she'd say...

19:44.330 --> 19:46.170
Wow, you're so good at rowing!

19:46.170 --> 19:48.080
It's cuz I grew up near the ocean.

19:48.080 --> 19:50.420
I wanna give it a try, too!

19:50.420 --> 19:52.290
Sure. Come over this way.

19:52.290 --> 19:54.170
What? But I'm scared!

19:54.170 --> 19:56.000
She's scared?

19:56.000 --> 19:59.130
So this is the kinda stuff
that women get afraid about?

19:59.130 --> 20:01.880
M-man, I dunno if I can pull that off...

20:02.330 --> 20:04.170
Let me grab hold of you, kay?

20:08.460 --> 20:10.830
Darling! Let's just go home already!

20:10.830 --> 20:13.210
No way! Look at them
holding hands over there!

20:15.920 --> 20:17.880
Eeeeeeek!

20:17.880 --> 20:19.380
Eeeeeeek....

20:19.380 --> 20:22.630
Hey! Just whaddya think
you're doing over there?!

20:22.630 --> 20:25.580
Listen up! If you're gonna cuddle,
then do it with me!

20:26.540 --> 20:27.880
Hup!

20:28.460 --> 20:30.750
COME TO PAPA, BABYYYY!

20:31.880 --> 20:34.290
<b>KERSPLAAAAAASH!</b>

20:35.670 --> 20:38.290
Ugh! Please noooooo!

20:38.290 --> 20:41.000
Damn you! What the hell was that?!

20:41.000 --> 20:43.830
Now my friggin' sailor uniform
is soaking wet!

20:43.830 --> 20:45.290
Listen, Ran. Just calm dow-

20:45.290 --> 20:47.170
Enough of your stupid hogwash!

20:47.170 --> 20:50.710
Better watch out, Lum!
You really pissed me off this time...

20:50.710 --> 20:52.920
AND I'M NOT GONNA FORGET IT!

20:55.960 --> 20:59.040
There's a lot more to
being a woman than I thought...

21:01.210 --> 21:03.540
But y'know, I'm not giving up!

21:04.080 --> 21:06.580
The day that I can wear you
will come for sure!

21:10.250 --> 21:13.830
Just wait for me! Sailor uniform!

22:46.080 --> 22:51.000
<b>A Chest Full of Longing!!</b>

22:46.080 --> 22:51.000
<b>Wish Upon a Star</b>

22:46.460 --> 22:47.960
On the next episode of "Urusei Yatsura"!

22:47.960 --> 22:49.040
It's all about money!

22:49.040 --> 22:50.790
Needs a little more passion...
